ust 2, 2016 at 11:46 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3415788902262402364</id><published>2016-08-02T11:01:47.081-06:00</published><updated>2016-08-02T11:01:47.081-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Putting Anonymous 12:14&amp;#39;s great post into pers...</title><content type='html'>Putting Anonymous 12:14&amp;#39;s great post into perspective-&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;Zollman still garners a lot of support from the community because he is a &amp;#39;really nice guy&amp;#39;.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;...who, according to Lt. Steven Phillips, doesn’t have a f***in’ clue how to do his job. He&amp;#39;s in way over his head and doesn&amp;#39;t have a clue what to do about having a sociopath as an employee.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Apparently, people a thousand miles from Council, Idaho (me) are paying more attention to what goes on in Adams County than do many residents.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1139150688883184277/comments/default/3415788902262402364'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1139150688883184277/comments/default/3415788902262402364'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/beware-adams-county-sociopath-will-soon.html?showComment=1470157307081#c3415788902262402364' title=''/><author><name>Elmo</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/beware-adams-county-sociopath-will-soon.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1139150688883184277' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1139150688883184277' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-596778671"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 2, 2016 at 11:01 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6962545537081683755</id><published>2016-08-02T05:47:58.968-06:00</published><updated>2016-08-02T05:47:58.968-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This incident is a stark illustration of the vital...</title><content type='html'>This incident is a stark illustration of the vital importance of making a video recording of any encounter with cops.  And if a cop tells you to stop recording or fork over your phone/camera, resist!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1139150688883184277/comments/default/6962545537081683755'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1139150688883184277/comments/default/6962545537081683755'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/beware-adams-county-sociopath-will-soon.html?showComment=1470138478968#c6962545537081683755' title=''/><author><name>JdL</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00630104950043758864</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/beware-adams-county-sociopath-will-soon.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1139150688883184277' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1139150688883184277' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1634901166"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 2, 2016 at 5:47 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5907007514034916884</id><published>2016-08-02T00:14:33.889-06:00</published><updated>2016-08-02T00:14:33.889-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thank you very much for writing this. It is a very...</title><content type='html'>Thank you very much for writing this. It is a very clear, concise and above all else entirely true account of the kind of crap we have been putting up with since the moron Ryan Zollman won the election three long years ago. His deputies have raped a drunken woman in a patrol car, assaulted and severly injured a 74-year old woman during a suspected DUI stop, somehow let a suicidal man into a jail cell with two disposable lighters in his pocket which he used to set himself on fire, terrified another elderly woman by tailgating and brightlighting her for miles down a dirt road all the way to her house, allowed one dangerous criminal to escape and terrify the whole town because the jailer was too stupid to count to five when he let the prisoners back inside from the tiny exercise yard... and of course shot an innocent man twelve times for no logical reason whatsoever and then somehow got away with it. The list goes on. This department has made state-wide headlines for no less than five seperate incidents. At one point, there were more lawsuits against the county than there were employees who worked in the Sheriff&amp;#39;s office. All this in a tiny rural county with a population of about 4000 people. But somehow, Zollman still garners a lot of support from the community because he is a &amp;quot;really nice guy&amp;quot;. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1139150688883184277/comments/default/5907007514034916884'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1139150688883184277/comments/default/5907007514034916884'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/beware-adams-county-sociopath-will-soon.html?showComment=1470118473889#c5907007514034916884' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/beware-adams-county-sociopath-will-soon.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1139150688883184277' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1139150688883184277' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-452342106"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 2, 2016 at 12:14 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1947757110690716753</id><published>2016-08-01T15:14:15.593-06:00</published><updated>2016-08-01T15:14:15.593-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Donna - North Dakota&#xa;&#xa;My post was lost, but want t...</title><content type='html'>Donna - North Dakota&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;My post was lost, but want this bit of history to be appreciated on the 70th anniversary of its occurrence.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://thefreethoughtproject.com/wwii-vets-arms-against-corrupt-cops-athens/</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1139150688883184277/comments/default/1947757110690716753'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1139150688883184277/comments/default/1947757110690716753'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/beware-adams-county-sociopath-will-soon.html?showComment=1470086055593#c1947757110690716753' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourti